  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThis could be a boolean, which the Dialog element (the only place which does something other than the default getEnabledState algorithm provides) could set the Enabled state on change of closedby.\n\nIt looks like Chromium also implements this as a boolean, rather than a function pointer: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/closewatcher/close_watcher.cc;l=69\n\nHappy to make the spec changes, just raising for completeness.\n\n/cc @mfreed7 @domenic ",
